    "strict_check": "now + .01 < derived earliest source-service completion bound; equality, stale, missing, nonfinite or bool times remain unknown. Keep existing target2 current same-owner capacity and all original endpoint/ledger/admission guards.",
    "new_modules": "Independent initial adapter v2 / recorded adapter v2 / campaign v2 and exact actual-schema regression tests. Source clone inverse AST records the sole guard replacement. No original receipt upgrade.",
    "proof_boundary": "A local proposal only; native execution still validates at wire arrival, delivered ACK and actual edge remain required. The earliest bound is not an exact current service-end sensor."
